l  that wait for us there  on the other side of the border in syria  the ongoing war is silencing syrians  voices on this side of the border in  turkey the fear of being deported is  forcing them to stay quiet  syrians say neither country is safe for  them anymore  al jazeera gaziantep turkey
 

